This is a clean-room JavaScript reimplementation inspired by
eo-overpass-predictor, Copyright (c) 2026 Julian Manning, MIT License:
https://github.com/julianManning/eo-overpass-predictor

No code from that project is included. Its method (SGP4 propagation,
swath/ROI intersection in a local equal-area projection, daytime/descending
filters, edge margin, TLE age) inspired this one. Its Python code is used
only as a test oracle in CI.

Third-party libraries in vendor/ keep their own licences; see vendor/README.md
and vendor/licenses/.
